WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:05.380 --> 00:00:09.384
This gun wasn't made to hit small targets.

00:00:14.389 --> 00:00:15.181
Niko?

00:00:16.766 --> 00:00:19.728
What did you say about small targets?

00:00:22.063 --> 00:00:23.982
Pick up the damn pace!

00:00:24.399 --> 00:00:25.567
Board them already!

00:00:28.903 --> 00:00:30.739
You boys ready?

00:00:37.912 --> 00:00:38.747
What's he doing?

00:00:41.583 --> 00:00:43.084
Hey, you!

00:00:54.846 --> 00:00:56.598
He just went off on his own again!

00:00:56.806 --> 00:00:58.099
What's new?

00:01:06.816 --> 00:01:09.110
Watch it!

00:01:11.196 --> 00:01:13.031
Hold on!

00:01:18.620 --> 00:01:19.454
Watch it!

00:01:20.455 --> 00:01:22.624
He just boarded us alone.

00:01:22.665 --> 00:01:25.668
-Is this guy crazy?
-Don't back down.

00:01:26.002 --> 00:01:26.961
Kill him!

00:01:44.521 --> 00:01:45.355
Don't move!

00:01:46.314 --> 00:01:47.232
Damn it.

00:01:47.482 --> 00:01:48.983
Put your hands up and get on your knees!

00:01:49.818 --> 00:01:50.693
Hurry up!

00:01:52.529 --> 00:01:53.363
Mika!

00:01:55.573 --> 00:01:56.574
Mika!

00:01:58.326 --> 00:01:59.160
Damn it.

00:02:00.537 --> 00:02:01.496
This is bad.

00:02:01.704 --> 00:02:03.164
-Mika.
-Mika.

00:02:03.540 --> 00:02:05.500
Ouch.

00:02:06.251 --> 00:02:08.169
You son of a bitch.

00:02:09.212 --> 00:02:12.715
You just ruined my beautiful face.

00:02:14.342 --> 00:02:16.845
I'll fill your face with holes.

00:02:17.679 --> 00:02:19.305
Hope you're ready.

00:02:30.358 --> 00:02:31.693
Don't move!

00:02:32.193 --> 00:02:34.112
Can't you see this gun?

